SUMMARY:Wine Fest Toronto: Spring 2026
DESCRIPTION:The city’s favourite wine and drinks festival returns this May long weekend to Toronto’s iconic Heritage Court in the Enercare Centre! \nThe multi-day festival invites guests to explore\, sip\, and discover at their own pace\, with fascinating wines and drinks from around the world\, shorter lines\, and a more elevated tasting experience designed for both seasoned wine and drink lovers and curious newcomers\, all in one place. \nTo complement guests’ tasting journey\, Wine Fest will feature music\, artisanal food truck eats\, and photo moments throughout the festival. The popular seminar sessions also return\, offering complimentary classes with admission\, allowing guests to expand their beverage knowledge. \nWine Fest Toronto is also introducing a flexible token system\, allowing guests to browse the full drinks list in advance\, plan their tastings through a digital wallet\, and purchase tokens seamlessly for a more personalized experience. \n‘The French Experience\,’ Powered by Taste France\, also makes its debut this spring\, offering guests a rare opportunity to experience the diversity of France’s winemaking traditions. \nA world of wine and drinks awaits! \nDate & Time: \nFriday\, May 15th\, 5:00 PM-10:00 PM \nSaturday\, May 16th\, 1:00 PM-10:00 PM\, \nSunday\, May 17th\, 1:00 PM-9:00 PM
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/wine-fest-toronto-spring-2026/
LOCATION:19 Nunavut Rd\, 19 Nunavut Rd\, Toronto\, ON M6K 3C3\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6K 3C3
CATEGORIES:Festivals,Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/wine-fest-toronto-spring-2026.png
END:VEVENT
