SUMMARY:East Asian Singles Mixer + Live Music
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a more intentional way to meet someone—without giving up your Friday night (long weekend) plans? \nEast Asian–focused mixer to start\, then opens to all. Celebrate Asian Heritage Month + long weekend with a live local band to end the night. \nWhen: Friday\, May 15\, 2026 | 7:30pm – 11:00pmWhere: Tenjin Karaoke Bar \n🕖 How the Night Flows \n7:30PM – 8:30PM | East Asian Early Access Singles Hour (Curated Window) \n\nDesigned for East & Southeast Asian singles seeking a more intentional and culturally familiar space to connect\n“East & Southeast Asian” would generally refer to Chinese\, Korean\, Japanese\, Taiwanese\, Vietnamese\, Filipino\, Thai\, Indonesian\, Malaysian\, Singaporean\, etc.\nQuiet\, conversation-first socializing before the room expands\n\n8:30PM – 11PM | Signature Singles Mixer (Professionals ages 28-45) \n\nOur typical open format mixer for likeminded professionals ages 28-45 – all ethnicities/cultures are welcome\nLow pressure\, unstructured mingling\n\n9:30PM – Late | Live Music Night (Open to Public) \n\nLive band + DJ: BitterXBroke\nGuests from mixer + general public combine into nightlife setting
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/east-asian-singles-mixer-live-music/
LOCATION:Tenjin Karaoke Bar\, 633 Gerrard St E 2nd Floor\, Toronto\, ON M4M 1Y2\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M4M 1Y2
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/east-asian-singles-mixer-live-music.png
END:VEVENT
