SUMMARY:Lulaworld 2026: Luis Franco with special guest Dianela Hernandez
DESCRIPTION:Lulaworld Festival (May 11 to 17) Join us at Lula Lounge to celebrate the 20th annual Lulaworld festival\, marking two decades of local and international jazz\, Latin\, Brazilian\, soul and folk from around the globe and around the corner. \nEvening Schedule� 7:00 PM – Doors open for dinner and drinks� 9:00 PM – Salsa lesson (no partner needed!)� 10:00 PM – Live salsa set� 11:00 PM – Keep the energy going with Lula’s Global Late Night Party! \nEnjoy Lula’s tropical-inspired dinner and drinks menu before the show. Dinner reservations available at lula.ca/reservations\, A la carte menu available.(GENERAL ADMISSION TICKETS DO NOT GUARANTEE SEATING) \n$79 + 18% GRATUITY DINNER PRIX FIX TICKETS AVAILABLEPrix fixe tickets include gratuity\, concert and dance lesson. \nLuis FrancoVenezuelan-born singer and composer Luis Franco boasts a 30-year musical career that has taken him to stages around the globe. Luis now brings his Worldwide Salsa show to audiences across Canada to further expand his musical journey and bring hard-hitting salsa to Toronto’s dance floors. \nDianela HernandezHaving performed extensively in Cuba and Turkey’s top hotels\, Dianela is a newer contributor to Toronto’s ever-evolving Latin music community\, singing everything from Cuban classics\, cha cha cha and merengue\, to pop\, soul and disco. For tonight’s performance\, Dianela will join Luis Franco’s ensemble on three of her favourite pieces from Franco’s high-energy repertoire.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/lulaworld-2026-luis-franco-with-special-guest-dianela-hernandez/
LOCATION:Lula Lounge\, 1585 Dundas St W\, Toronto\, M6K 1T9
CATEGORIES:Festivals,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/lulaworld-2026-luis-franco-with-special-guest-dianela-hernandez.png
END:VEVENT
